  "titles": {
    "_tiers_note": "Akkadian native ladder, ascending (barony, march, county, duchy, principality, kingdom, empire). -u/-utu rhyme (Hazannu/Hazannutu ... Sharru/Sharrutu). Hazannu (mayor) barony; Massaru (warden) march; Shaknu (appointed governor) county; Turtanu (commander-in-chief) duchy; Rubu (prince) principality; Sharru (king) kingdom; Shar-kishshati (king of the totality) emperor over the Kishshatu. (Rank titles are the real Akkadian register, allowed.) DISPLAY titles are English per display_policy; the Akkadian forms above are for NPC dialogue only.",
    "display_policy": "Ruler/domain titles shown in setting-gen, domain lists and vassal trees are ENGLISH. The *_native conlang forms are for NPC DIALOGUE ONLY, never for structural/UI displays.",
